{"documents": [{"id": "3d4069c4-c4d9-447c-ad47-175f3dd97dcf", "content": "Yes, CalmTalk offers online therapy sessions. It is a mental health platform where licensed therapists provide services through telehealth. Therapists complete onboarding including credentialing, setting up a profile with therapeutic approaches and specialties, and scheduling available slots for sessions in the provider portal. Sessions include 50-minute individual therapy and extended or couples sessions, all conducted online with telehealth privacy standards compliance. Therapists are matched with clients through the platform, and clinical sessions including crisis support are managed within the platform interface [ref_id:0][ref_id:1][ref_id:3].", "title": "mcp://answersynthesis", "url": "mcp://answersynthesis/", "metadata": "text/plain", "knowledgeSourceIndex": 0}, {"id": "146e1444-0ebc-445a-917e-4fea6ff6fccd", "content": "{
  "id": "ddb51316892d_aHR0cHM6Ly9jYWxtdGFsa29uYm9hcmRpbmcuYmxvYi5jb3JlLndpbmRvd3MubmV0L2NhbG10YWxrYWRtaW5pdHJhdGlvbi9DYWxtJTIwVGFsayUyME9uYm9hcmRpbmclMjBHdWlkZS5wZGY1_markdown_document_13",
  "content": ". How to Update Profile: Go to Provider Portal \u003E My Profile. Edit profile information,\r\nspecialties, or photo. Click Save. Note: Adding new clinical specialties requires\r\ncredentialing re-verification.\r\n\r\n. How to Request Account Changes: Submit a request through Help \u0026 Support \u003E Profile\r\n\u0026 Account Changes.\r\n\r\n. How to Request Official Documents: Navigate to HR Hub \u003E Document Requests,\r\nselect the desired document template, specify date ranges if necessary, and submit.\r\n\r\n. How to Contact HR: Send an email to hr@calmtalk.com or open a support ticket under\r\nHR \u0026 Administration inside the platform dashboard.\r\n\r\n\u00B7 How to Request Support:\r\n\r\no Administrative Support: Log a ticket via Help \u0026 Support \u003E Administrative.\r\n\u2610\r\n\r\no Technical Support: Email techsupport@calmtalk.com or use the in-app chat.\r\n\u2610\r\n\r\no Clinical \u0026 Crisis Support: For client crisis situations, use the red Emergency\r\n\u2610\r\nEscalation Button inside the live session interface for immediate routing to the 24/7\r\nClinical Risk Team.\r\n",
  "title": "Calm Talk Mental Health Platform Therapist Onboarding, HR Administration, and Compensation Guide",
  "category": "4. Therapist-Specific Procedures (Quick Reference)",
  "subcategory": "Operational Quick Guide"
}", "title": "https://calmtalkdb.search.windows.net/indexes/calmtalk-therapist-knowledge-v2/docs/ddb51316892d_aHR0cHM6Ly9jYWxtdGFsa29uYm9hcmRpbmcuYmxvYi5jb3JlLndpbmRvd3MubmV0L2NhbG10YWxrYWRtaW5pdHJhdGlvbi9DYWxtJTIwVGFsayUyME9uYm9hcmRpbmclMjBHdWlkZS5wZGY1_markdown_document_13?$select=title%2Ccontent%2Ccategory%2Csubcategory%2Cid&api-version=2026-08-01-preview&allowUnsafeKeys=true", "url": "https://calmtalkdb.search.windows.net/indexes/calmtalk-therapist-knowledge-v2/docs/ddb51316892d_aHR0cHM6Ly9jYWxtdGFsa29uYm9hcmRpbmcuYmxvYi5jb3JlLndpbmRvd3MubmV0L2NhbG10YWxrYWRtaW5pdHJhdGlvbi9DYWxtJTIwVGFsayUyME9uYm9hcmRpbmclMjBHdWlkZS5wZGY1_markdown_document_13?$select=title%2Ccontent%2Ccategory%2Csubcategory%2Cid&api-version=2026-08-01-preview&allowUnsafeKeys=true", "metadata": "application/json", "knowledgeSourceIndex": 0}, {"id": "15a4f6a8-f5ed-479d-b2b7-f4ce7cf0c0a4", "content": "{
  "id": "ddb51316892d_aHR0cHM6Ly9jYWxtdGFsa29uYm9hcmRpbmcuYmxvYi5jb3JlLndpbmRvd3MubmV0L2NhbG10YWxrYWRtaW5pdHJhdGlvbi9DYWxtJTIwVGFsayUyME9uYm9hcmRpbmclMjBHdWlkZS5wZGY1_markdown_document_3",
  "content": "Once credentialing and background checks clear successfully, the therapist receives an email\r\nnotification with login credentials for the Calm Talk Provider Portal.\r\n\r\nTo complete activation:\r\n\r\n1\\. Bio \u0026 Approach: Log into the portal and write a professional biography detailing\r\ntherapeutic approach and clinical philosophy.\r\n\r\n2\\. Specialties \u0026 Modalities: Select clinical specialties (e.g., anxiety, depression, trauma),\r\ntreatment modalities (e.g., CBT, EMDR, Psychodynamic), and language proficiencies.\r\n\r\n3\\. Availability: Set recurring availability slots in the portal schedule.\r\n\r\n4\\. Payout Configuration: Verify bank details and submit for final account activation.\r\nProfiles are activated in the live client directory within 24 hours of submission.",
  "title": "Calm Talk Mental Health Platform Therapist Onboarding, HR Administration, and Compensation Guide",
  "category": "1. Onboarding",
  "subcategory": "Profile Activation Process"
}", "title": "https://calmtalkdb.search.windows.net/indexes/calmtalk-therapist-knowledge-v2/docs/ddb51316892d_aHR0cHM6Ly9jYWxtdGFsa29uYm9hcmRpbmcuYmxvYi5jb3JlLndpbmRvd3MubmV0L2NhbG10YWxrYWRtaW5pdHJhdGlvbi9DYWxtJTIwVGFsayUyME9uYm9hcmRpbmclMjBHdWlkZS5wZGY1_markdown_document_3?$select=title%2Ccontent%2Ccategory%2Csubcategory%2Cid&api-version=2026-08-01-preview&allowUnsafeKeys=true", "url": "https://calmtalkdb.search.windows.net/indexes/calmtalk-therapist-knowledge-v2/docs/ddb51316892d_aHR0cHM6Ly9jYWxtdGFsa29uYm9hcmRpbmcuYmxvYi5jb3JlLndpbmRvd3MubmV0L2NhbG10YWxrYWRtaW5pdHJhdGlvbi9DYWxtJTIwVGFsayUyME9uYm9hcmRpbmclMjBHdWlkZS5wZGY1_markdown_document_3?$select=title%2Ccontent%2Ccategory%2Csubcategory%2Cid&api-version=2026-08-01-preview&allowUnsafeKeys=true", "metadata": "application/json", "knowledgeSourceIndex": 0}, {"id": "9cedd6dd-0b89-45df-b1a9-3ac8bc725f75", "content": "{
  "id": "ddb51316892d_aHR0cHM6Ly9jYWxtdGFsa29uYm9hcmRpbmcuYmxvYi5jb3JlLndpbmRvd3MubmV0L2NhbG10YWxrYWRtaW5pdHJhdGlvbi9DYWxtJTIwVGFsayUyME9uYm9hcmRpbmclMjBHdWlkZS5wZGY1_markdown_document_9",
  "content": "Therapist compensation is calculated based on completed session units and contract tier\r\n\r\n\u003C!-- PageBreak --\u003E\r\n\r\nstructure:\r\n\r\nTotal Earnings = (Completed Sessions x Base Rate) \u002B Incentive Multipliers\r\n\r\n\u25CF\r\n50-Minute Individual Session: Standard hourly unit base rate.\r\n\r\n\u00B7 80-Minute Extended/Couples Session:\r\n1.5\u00D7\r\nbase rate.\r\n\r\n\u00B7 Asynchronous Messaging Support (Optional): Flat monthly rate per active assigned\r\nclient.",
  "title": "Calm Talk Mental Health Platform Therapist Onboarding, HR Administration, and Compensation Guide",
  "category": "3. Payment \u0026 Compensation",
  "subcategory": "Payment Calculation Rules"
}", "title": "https://calmtalkdb.search.windows.net/indexes/calmtalk-therapist-knowledge-v2/docs/ddb51316892d_aHR0cHM6Ly9jYWxtdGFsa29uYm9hcmRpbmcuYmxvYi5jb3JlLndpbmRvd3MubmV0L2NhbG10YWxrYWRtaW5pdHJhdGlvbi9DYWxtJTIwVGFsayUyME9uYm9hcmRpbmclMjBHdWlkZS5wZGY1_markdown_document_9?$select=title%2Ccontent%2Ccategory%2Csubcategory%2Cid&api-version=2026-08-01-preview&allowUnsafeKeys=true", "url": "https://calmtalkdb.search.windows.net/indexes/calmtalk-therapist-knowledge-v2/docs/ddb51316892d_aHR0cHM6Ly9jYWxtdGFsa29uYm9hcmRpbmcuYmxvYi5jb3JlLndpbmRvd3MubmV0L2NhbG10YWxrYWRtaW5pdHJhdGlvbi9DYWxtJTIwVGFsayUyME9uYm9hcmRpbmclMjBHdWlkZS5wZGY1_markdown_document_9?$select=title%2Ccontent%2Ccategory%2Csubcategory%2Cid&api-version=2026-08-01-preview&allowUnsafeKeys=true", "metadata": "application/json", "knowledgeSourceIndex": 0}, {"id": "439e0759-850d-4cd4-89e2-9d1d16431011", "content": "{
