  "content": "#### Bank Information Update Procedure\r\n\r\n1\\. Go to Account Settings \u003E Billing \u0026 Payouts.\r\n\r\n2\\. Input updated account details (Bank Name, Account Holder, Account/IBAN Number,\r\nRouting/SWIFT Code).\r\n\r\n3\\. Complete Two-Factor Authentication (2FA) verification.\r\n\r\n4\\. Upload supporting verification (voided check or official bank letter matching legal name).\r\n\r\n5\\. Notice Period: Changes must be submitted at least 5 business days prior to the next\r\nbilling cycle cutoff to apply to the upcoming payout.\r\n\r\n\r\n#### Personal Information Update Procedure\r\n\r\n\u003C!-- PageBreak --\u003E\r\n\r\n\u00B7 Legal Name / Identity Changes: Upload official legal documentation (marriage certificate,\r\ndeed poll, or updated ID) under Account Settings \u003E Legal Identity. HR reviews and\r\nupdates records within 48 hours.\r\n\r\n. Contact \u0026 Address Updates: Phone numbers, mailing addresses, and emergency\r\ncontact details can be edited directly under Account Settings \u003E Profile and take effect\r\nimmediately.",
  "title": "Calm Talk Mental Health Platform Therapist Onboarding, HR Administration, and Compensation Guide",
  "category": "2. HR \u0026 Administration",
  "subcategory": "Information Update Procedures"
}", "title": "https://calmtalkdb.search.windows.net/indexes/calmtalk-therapist-knowledge-v2/docs/ddb51316892d_aHR0cHM6Ly9jYWxtdGFsa29uYm9hcmRpbmcuYmxvYi5jb3JlLndpbmRvd3MubmV0L2NhbG10YWxrYWRtaW5pdHJhdGlvbi9DYWxtJTIwVGFsayUyME9uYm9hcmRpbmclMjBHdWlkZS5wZGY1_markdown_document_6?$select=title%2Ccontent%2Ccategory%2Csubcategory%2Cid&api-version=2026-08-01-preview&allowUnsafeKeys=true", "url": "https://calmtalkdb.search.windows.net/indexes/calmtalk-therapist-knowledge-v2/docs/ddb51316892d_aHR0cHM6Ly9jYWxtdGFsa29uYm9hcmRpbmcuYmxvYi5jb3JlLndpbmRvd3MubmV0L2NhbG10YWxrYWRtaW5pdHJhdGlvbi9DYWxtJTIwVGFsayUyME9uYm9hcmRpbmclMjBHdWlkZS5wZGY1_markdown_document_6?$select=title%2Ccontent%2Ccategory%2Csubcategory%2Cid&api-version=2026-08-01-preview&allowUnsafeKeys=true", "metadata": "application/json", "knowledgeSourceIndex": 0}, {"id": "9fd34463-f821-4653-83b0-665222fabc3c", "content": "{
  "id": "ddb51316892d_aHR0cHM6Ly9jYWxtdGFsa29uYm9hcmRpbmcuYmxvYi5jb3JlLndpbmRvd3MubmV0L2NhbG10YWxrYWRtaW5pdHJhdGlvbi9DYWxtJTIwVGFsayUyME9uYm9hcmRpbmclMjBHdWlkZS5wZGY1_markdown_document_3",
  "content": "Once credentialing and background checks clear successfully, the therapist receives an email\r\nnotification with login credentials for the Calm Talk Provider Portal.\r\n\r\nTo complete activation:\r\n\r\n1\\. Bio \u0026 Approach: Log into the portal and write a professional biography detailing\r\ntherapeutic approach and clinical philosophy.\r\n\r\n2\\. Specialties \u0026 Modalities: Select clinical specialties (e.g., anxiety, depression, trauma),\r\ntreatment modalities (e.g., CBT, EMDR, Psychodynamic), and language proficiencies.\r\n\r\n3\\. Availability: Set recurring availability slots in the portal schedule.\r\n\r\n4\\. Payout Configuration: Verify bank details and submit for final account activation.\r\nProfiles are activated in the live client directory within 24 hours of submission.",
