  "id": "ddb51316892d_aHR0cHM6Ly9jYWxtdGFsa29uYm9hcmRpbmcuYmxvYi5jb3JlLndpbmRvd3MubmV0L2NhbG10YWxrYWRtaW5pdHJhdGlvbi9DYWxtJTIwVGFsayUyME9uYm9hcmRpbmclMjBHdWlkZS5wZGY1_markdown_document_1",
  "content": "#### 1. Registration \u0026 Document Submission\r\n\r\no Complete the initial registration form on the Calm Talk Provider Portal.\r\n\u2610\r\n\r\no Upload all required identity, academic, clinical licensing, and financial documents.\r\n\u2610\r\n\r\n\r\n#### 2. Credentialing \u0026 Background Verification\r\n\r\no The Calm Talk Operations \u0026 HR Team verifies license validity with state/national\r\n\u2610\r\nlicensing boards.\r\n\r\no Background checks and credential verification are conducted by compliance staff.\r\n\u2610\r\n\r\n3\\. Clinical Orientation \u0026 System Walkthrough\r\n\r\no Complete interactive training modules covering telehealth privacy standards\r\n\u2610\r\n(HIPAA/GDPR compliance).\r\n\r\no Review EHR clinical documentation standards, platform workflow, and emergency risk\r\n\u2610\r\nprotocols.\r\n\r\n\r\n#### 4. Profile Activation \u0026 Schedule Setup\r\n\r\no Set active clinical hours and define recurring availability in the integrated calendar.\r\n\r\no Highlight primary practice areas, therapeutic approaches, and target demographics.\r\n\u2610\r\n\r\n\u003C!-- PageBreak --\u003E\r\n\r\no Finalize setup for client matching.\r\n\u2610",
