  "content": "1\\. Detailed payment breakdowns are made available under Provider Portal \u003E Financials \u003E\r\nStatements.\r\n\r\n2\\. Itemized statements populate 2 days prior to each scheduled disbursement date.\r\n\r\n3\\. Statements include session dates, client identifiers, session durations, no-show\r\ncompensations, and applicable administrative adjustments.\r\n\r\n4\\. Annual earnings summaries (e.g., 1099/W-2 equivalent forms) are archived and\r\ndownloadable on demand.",
