  "id": "ddb51316892d_aHR0cHM6Ly9jYWxtdGFsa29uYm9hcmRpbmcuYmxvYi5jb3JlLndpbmRvd3MubmV0L2NhbG10YWxrYWRtaW5pdHJhdGlvbi9DYWxtJTIwVGFsayUyME9uYm9hcmRpbmclMjBHdWlkZS5wZGY1_markdown_document_13",
  "content": ". How to Update Profile: Go to Provider Portal \u003E My Profile. Edit profile information,\r\nspecialties, or photo. Click Save. Note: Adding new clinical specialties requires\r\ncredentialing re-verification.\r\n\r\n. How to Request Account Changes: Submit a request through Help \u0026 Support \u003E Profile\r\n\u0026 Account Changes.\r\n\r\n. How to Request Official Documents: Navigate to HR Hub \u003E Document Requests,\r\nselect the desired document template, specify date ranges if necessary, and submit.\r\n\r\n. How to Contact HR: Send an email to hr@calmtalk.com or open a support ticket under\r\nHR \u0026 Administration inside the platform dashboard.\r\n\r\n\u00B7 How to Request Support:\r\n\r\no Administrative Support: Log a ticket via Help \u0026 Support \u003E Administrative.\r\n\u2610\r\n\r\no Technical Support: Email techsupport@calmtalk.com or use the in-app chat.\r\n\u2610\r\n\r\no Clinical \u0026 Crisis Support: For client crisis situations, use the red Emergency\r\n\u2610\r\nEscalation Button inside the live session interface for immediate routing to the 24/7\r\nClinical Risk Team.\r\n",
