  "content": "\u00B7 Client Late Cancellation (\u003C 24 Hours): The therapist receives 100% of the standard\r\nsession payout.\r\n\r\n. Client No-Show: If a client fails to attend within 15 minutes of session start time, the\r\ntherapist logs the no-show in the EHR portal and receives 100% of the session fee.\r\n\r\n\u00B7 Therapist Cancellation: Must be initiated at least 24 hours prior to session start.\r\nUnexcused late cancellations by therapists (\u003C 24 hours) may incur quality warnings or\r\nadministrative fees.",
