  "id": "ddb51316892d_aHR0cHM6Ly9jYWxtdGFsa29uYm9hcmRpbmcuYmxvYi5jb3JlLndpbmRvd3MubmV0L2NhbG10YWxrYWRtaW5pdHJhdGlvbi9DYWxtJTIwVGFsayUyME9uYm9hcmRpbmclMjBHdWlkZS5wZGY1_markdown_document_6",
  "content": "#### Bank Information Update Procedure\r\n\r\n1\\. Go to Account Settings \u003E Billing \u0026 Payouts.\r\n\r\n2\\. Input updated account details (Bank Name, Account Holder, Account/IBAN Number,\r\nRouting/SWIFT Code).\r\n\r\n3\\. Complete Two-Factor Authentication (2FA) verification.\r\n\r\n4\\. Upload supporting verification (voided check or official bank letter matching legal name).\r\n\r\n5\\. Notice Period: Changes must be submitted at least 5 business days prior to the next\r\nbilling cycle cutoff to apply to the upcoming payout.\r\n\r\n\r\n#### Personal Information Update Procedure\r\n\r\n\u003C!-- PageBreak --\u003E\r\n\r\n\u00B7 Legal Name / Identity Changes: Upload official legal documentation (marriage certificate,\r\ndeed poll, or updated ID) under Account Settings \u003E Legal Identity. HR reviews and\r\nupdates records within 48 hours.\r\n\r\n. Contact \u0026 Address Updates: Phone numbers, mailing addresses, and emergency\r\ncontact details can be edited directly under Account Settings \u003E Profile and take effect\r\nimmediately.",
