  "id": "ddb51316892d_aHR0cHM6Ly9jYWxtdGFsa29uYm9hcmRpbmcuYmxvYi5jb3JlLndpbmRvd3MubmV0L2NhbG10YWxrYWRtaW5pdHJhdGlvbi9DYWxtJTIwVGFsayUyME9uYm9hcmRpbmclMjBHdWlkZS5wZGY1_markdown_document_1",
  "content": "#### 1. Registration \u0026 Document Submission\r\n\r\no Complete the initial registration form on the Calm Talk Provider Portal.\r\n\u2610\r\n\r\no Upload all required identity, academic, clinical licensing, and financial documents.\r\n\u2610\r\n\r\n\r\n#### 2. Credentialing \u0026 Background Verification\r\n\r\no The Calm Talk Operations \u0026 HR Team verifies license validity with state/national\r\n\u2610\r\nlicensing boards.\r\n\r\no Background checks and credential verification are conducted by compliance staff.\r\n\u2610\r\n\r\n3\\. Clinical Orientation \u0026 System Walkthrough\r\n\r\no Complete interactive training modules covering telehealth privacy standards\r\n\u2610\r\n(HIPAA/GDPR compliance).\r\n\r\no Review EHR clinical documentation standards, platform workflow, and emergency risk\r\n\u2610\r\nprotocols.\r\n\r\n\r\n#### 4. Profile Activation \u0026 Schedule Setup\r\n\r\no Set active clinical hours and define recurring availability in the integrated calendar.\r\n\r\no Highlight primary practice areas, therapeutic approaches, and target demographics.\r\n\u2610\r\n\r\n\u003C!-- PageBreak --\u003E\r\n\r\no Finalize setup for client matching.\r\n\u2610",
  "title": "Calm Talk Mental Health Platform Therapist Onboarding, HR Administration, and Compensation Guide",
  "category": "1. Onboarding",
  "subcategory": "Therapist Onboarding Process"
}", "title": "https://calmtalkdb.search.windows.net/indexes/calmtalk-therapist-knowledge-v2/docs/ddb51316892d_aHR0cHM6Ly9jYWxtdGFsa29uYm9hcmRpbmcuYmxvYi5jb3JlLndpbmRvd3MubmV0L2NhbG10YWxrYWRtaW5pdHJhdGlvbi9DYWxtJTIwVGFsayUyME9uYm9hcmRpbmclMjBHdWlkZS5wZGY1_markdown_document_1?$select=title%2Ccontent%2Ccategory%2Csubcategory%2Cid&api-version=2026-08-01-preview&allowUnsafeKeys=true", "url": "https://calmtalkdb.search.windows.net/indexes/calmtalk-therapist-knowledge-v2/docs/ddb51316892d_aHR0cHM6Ly9jYWxtdGFsa29uYm9hcmRpbmcuYmxvYi5jb3JlLndpbmRvd3MubmV0L2NhbG10YWxrYWRtaW5pdHJhdGlvbi9DYWxtJTIwVGFsayUyME9uYm9hcmRpbmclMjBHdWlkZS5wZGY1_markdown_document_1?$select=title%2Ccontent%2Ccategory%2Csubcategory%2Cid&api-version=2026-08-01-preview&allowUnsafeKeys=true", "metadata": "application/json", "knowledgeSourceIndex": 0}, {"id": "3cce9770-d414-4786-9401-facc19e8a9d0", "content": "{
  "id": "ddb51316892d_aHR0cHM6Ly9jYWxtdGFsa29uYm9hcmRpbmcuYmxvYi5jb3JlLndpbmRvd3MubmV0L2NhbG10YWxrYWRtaW5pdHJhdGlvbi9DYWxtJTIwVGFsayUyME9uYm9hcmRpbmclMjBHdWlkZS5wZGY1_markdown_document_5",
  "content": "#### Employment Certificate Process\r\n\r\n1\\. Navigate to Provider Portal \u003E HR Support \u003E Request Document.\r\n\r\n2\\. Select Certificate of Employment.\r\n\r\n3\\. Specify the receiving authority or purpose (optional).\r\n\r\n4\\. The requested document is generated digitally and sent to the registered email within 3\r\nbusiness days.\r\n\r\n\r\n#### Salary / Earnings Certificate Process\r\n\r\n1\\. Navigate to Provider Portal \u003E HR Support \u003E Request Document.\r\n\r\n2\\. Select Salary / Earnings Certificate.\r\n\r\n3\\. Choose the required date range (e.g., last 3 months, past 12 months, calendar year).\r\n\r\n4\\. The HR Operations team generates a verified earnings statement within 3-5 business\r\ndays.\r\n\r\n\r\n#### Contract-Related Procedures\r\n\r\n\u00B7 Contract Amendments: Any modifications to contract terms, fee structures, or clinical\r\nscope require a formal written addendum executed via DocuSign.\r\n\r\n\u00B7 Contract Renewal: Standard service agreements undergo annual review 30 days prior to\r\ncontract expiration.\r\n\r\n\u00B7 Termination \u0026 Offboarding: Therapists must provide a minimum 30-day written notice\r\nprior to terminating their agreement to ensure safe transition of active clients and continuity\r\nof care.",
  "title": "Calm Talk Mental Health Platform Therapist Onboarding, HR Administration, and Compensation Guide",
  "category": "2. HR \u0026 Administration",
  "subcategory": "Certificate Request Processes"
}", "title": "https://calmtalkdb.search.windows.net/indexes/calmtalk-therapist-knowledge-v2/docs/ddb51316892d_aHR0cHM6Ly9jYWxtdGFsa29uYm9hcmRpbmcuYmxvYi5jb3JlLndpbmRvd3MubmV0L2NhbG10YWxrYWRtaW5pdHJhdGlvbi9DYWxtJTIwVGFsayUyME9uYm9hcmRpbmclMjBHdWlkZS5wZGY1_markdown_document_5?$select=title%2Ccontent%2Ccategory%2Csubcategory%2Cid&api-version=2026-08-01-preview&allowUnsafeKeys=true", "url": "https://calmtalkdb.search.windows.net/indexes/calmtalk-therapist-knowledge-v2/docs/ddb51316892d_aHR0cHM6Ly9jYWxtdGFsa29uYm9hcmRpbmcuYmxvYi5jb3JlLndpbmRvd3MubmV0L2NhbG10YWxrYWRtaW5pdHJhdGlvbi9DYWxtJTIwVGFsayUyME9uYm9hcmRpbmclMjBHdWlkZS5wZGY1_markdown_document_5?$select=title%2Ccontent%2Ccategory%2Csubcategory%2Cid&api-version=2026-08-01-preview&allowUnsafeKeys=true", "metadata": "application/json", "knowledgeSourceIndex": 0}, {"id": "c0cf05d3-8840-4b9d-921c-11d21396d89b", "content": "{
  "id": "ddb51316892d_aHR0cHM6Ly9jYWxtdGFsa29uYm9hcmRpbmcuYmxvYi5jb3JlLndpbmRvd3MubmV0L2NhbG10YWxrYWRtaW5pdHJhdGlvbi9DYWxtJTIwVGFsayUyME9uYm9hcmRpbmclMjBHdWlkZS5wZGY1_markdown_document_0",
  "content": "To maintain clinical standards and regulatory compliance, therapists must submit valid copies of\r\nthe following documents during registration:\r\n\r\n. Government-Issued Photo ID: Valid Passport, Driver\u0027s License, or National Identification\r\nCard.\r\n\r\n\u00B7 Professional License: Active mental health license (e.g., Licensed Clinical Psychologist,\r\nLMFT, LCSW, LPC) issued by the relevant state or national regulatory authority.\r\n\r\n\u00B7 Academic Credentials: Master\u0027s or Doctoral degree certificate in psychology, counseling,\r\nsocial work, or a related mental health field.\r\n\r\n\u00B7 Proof of Malpractice Insurance: Current professional liability/malpractice insurance policy\r\ncertificate meeting minimum coverage requirements.\r\n\r\n\u00B7 Updated Curriculum Vitae (CV): Documenting clinical experience, specialties, and\r\nprofessional background.\r\n\r\n\u00B7 Direct Deposit / Banking Information: Voided check, official bank statement header, or\r\nverified bank document containing account holder name, IBAN/Account Number, and\r\nSWIFT/Routing code.",
  "title": "Calm Talk Mental Health Platform Therapist Onboarding, HR Administration, and Compensation Guide",
  "category": "1. Onboarding",
  "subcategory": "Required Onboarding Documents"
}", "title": "https://calmtalkdb.search.windows.net/indexes/calmtalk-therapist-knowledge-v2/docs/ddb51316892d_aHR0cHM6Ly9jYWxtdGFsa29uYm9hcmRpbmcuYmxvYi5jb3JlLndpbmRvd3MubmV0L2NhbG10YWxrYWRtaW5pdHJhdGlvbi9DYWxtJTIwVGFsayUyME9uYm9hcmRpbmclMjBHdWlkZS5wZGY1_markdown_document_0?$select=title%2Ccontent%2Ccategory%2Csubcategory%2Cid&api-version=2026-08-01-preview&allowUnsafeKeys=true", "url": "https://calmtalkdb.search.windows.net/indexes/calmtalk-therapist-knowledge-v2/docs/ddb51316892d_aHR0cHM6Ly9jYWxtdGFsa29uYm9hcmRpbmcuYmxvYi5jb3JlLndpbmRvd3MubmV0L2NhbG10YWxrYWRtaW5pdHJhdGlvbi9DYWxtJTIwVGFsayUyME9uYm9hcmRpbmclMjBHdWlkZS5wZGY1_markdown_document_0?$select=title%2Ccontent%2Ccategory%2Csubcategory%2Cid&api-version=2026-08-01-preview&allowUnsafeKeys=true", "metadata": "application/json", "knowledgeSourceIndex": 0}, {"id": "4b90ceb3-2af0-479c-a156-89eee48ad0b7", "content": "{
  "id": "ddb51316892d_aHR0cHM6Ly9jYWxtdGFsa29uYm9hcmRpbmcuYmxvYi5jb3JlLndpbmRvd3MubmV0L2NhbG10YWxrYWRtaW5pdHJhdGlvbi9DYWxtJTIwVGFsayUyME9uYm9hcmRpbmclMjBHdWlkZS5wZGY1_markdown_document_6",
  "content": "#### Bank Information Update Procedure\r\n\r\n1\\. Go to Account Settings \u003E Billing \u0026 Payouts.\r\n\r\n2\\. Input updated account details (Bank Name, Account Holder, Account/IBAN Number,\r\nRouting/SWIFT Code).\r\n\r\n3\\. Complete Two-Factor Authentication (2FA) verification.\r\n\r\n4\\. Upload supporting verification (voided check or official bank letter matching legal name).\r\n\r\n5\\. Notice Period: Changes must be submitted at least 5 business days prior to the next\r\nbilling cycle cutoff to apply to the upcoming payout.\r\n\r\n\r\n#### Personal Information Update Procedure\r\n\r\n\u003C!-- PageBreak --\u003E\r\n\r\n\u00B7 Legal Name / Identity Changes: Upload official legal documentation (marriage certificate,\r\ndeed poll, or updated ID) under Account Settings \u003E Legal Identity. HR reviews and\r\nupdates records within 48 hours.\r\n\r\n. Contact \u0026 Address Updates: Phone numbers, mailing addresses, and emergency\r\ncontact details can be edited directly under Account Settings \u003E Profile and take effect\r\nimmediately.",
  "title": "Calm Talk Mental Health Platform Therapist Onboarding, HR Administration, and Compensation Guide",
  "category": "2. HR \u0026 Administration",
  "subcategory": "Information Update Procedures"
}", "title": "https://calmtalkdb.search.windows.net/indexes/calmtalk-therapist-knowledge-v2/docs/ddb51316892d_aHR0cHM6Ly9jYWxtdGFsa29uYm9hcmRpbmcuYmxvYi5jb3JlLndpbmRvd3MubmV0L2NhbG10YWxrYWRtaW5pdHJhdGlvbi9DYWxtJTIwVGFsayUyME9uYm9hcmRpbmclMjBHdWlkZS5wZGY1_markdown_document_6?$select=title%2Ccontent%2Ccategory%2Csubcategory%2Cid&api-version=2026-08-01-preview&allowUnsafeKeys=true", "url": "https://calmtalkdb.search.windows.net/indexes/calmtalk-therapist-knowledge-v2/docs/ddb51316892d_aHR0cHM6Ly9jYWxtdGFsa29uYm9hcmRpbmcuYmxvYi5jb3JlLndpbmRvd3MubmV0L2NhbG10YWxrYWRtaW5pdHJhdGlvbi9DYWxtJTIwVGFsayUyME9uYm9hcmRpbmclMjBHdWlkZS5wZGY1_markdown_document_6?$select=title%2Ccontent%2Ccategory%2Csubcategory%2Cid&api-version=2026-08-01-preview&allowUnsafeKeys=true", "metadata": "application/json", "knowledgeSourceIndex": 0}, {"id": "c3bf0f6b-1ba0-4021-9f18-04a3d0798954", "content": "{
