  "content": "\u00B7 Payout Frequency: Bi-weekly (every two weeks on alternate Fridays).\r\n\r\n\u00B7 Payment Cycle Cutoff: Midnight (11:59 PM UTC) on the Sunday preceding payday.\r\n\r\n\u00B7 Disbursement Method: Direct Bank Transfer (ACH, SEPA, or International Wire) via\r\nsecure automated platform processors.",
