  "id": "ddb51316892d_aHR0cHM6Ly9jYWxtdGFsa29uYm9hcmRpbmcuYmxvYi5jb3JlLndpbmRvd3MubmV0L2NhbG10YWxrYWRtaW5pdHJhdGlvbi9DYWxtJTIwVGFsayUyME9uYm9hcmRpbmclMjBHdWlkZS5wZGY1_markdown_document_3",
  "content": "Once credentialing and background checks clear successfully, the therapist receives an email\r\nnotification with login credentials for the Calm Talk Provider Portal.\r\n\r\nTo complete activation:\r\n\r\n1\\. Bio \u0026 Approach: Log into the portal and write a professional biography detailing\r\ntherapeutic approach and clinical philosophy.\r\n\r\n2\\. Specialties \u0026 Modalities: Select clinical specialties (e.g., anxiety, depression, trauma),\r\ntreatment modalities (e.g., CBT, EMDR, Psychodynamic), and language proficiencies.\r\n\r\n3\\. Availability: Set recurring availability slots in the portal schedule.\r\n\r\n4\\. Payout Configuration: Verify bank details and submit for final account activation.\r\nProfiles are activated in the live client directory within 24 hours of submission.",
