  "content": "If a submitted document is rejected due to expiration, illegibility, or missing information:\r\n\r\n. Notification: An automated email and portal alert detailing the specific reason for rejection\r\nis issued within 48 hours.\r\n\r\n\u00B7 Submission Window: Therapists must upload corrected or updated documents via the\r\n\r\n\u003C!-- PageBreak --\u003E\r\n\r\nProvider Portal within 7 business days.\r\n\r\n. Non-Compliance: Failure to resubmit required documentation within 14 business days\r\nresults in temporary application deactivation, requiring the onboarding process to be\r\nrestarted.",
